  "body": "<div><div><div><div><div><div>\n  \n  <div><p>When you travel and book out with your agency do you say you are available for self tapes while you are away? Maybe you don’t and potentially miss out on casting opportunities because you can’t imagine self taping in a hotel room or cramming gear into your already over-stuffed vehicle. </p></div>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    \n  <div>\n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      <div>\n        <div>\n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img alt=\"\" src=\"/blog/images/90bdf84560-unsplash-image-1Spvd7ktFX4.webp\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1875\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption>\n          <div></div>\n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  </div>\n\n  \n\n</div></div><div><div><div>\n  \n  <div><p>Do you live in tight quarters and bulky self tape equipment is not only an eye sore but it is occupying valuable square footage? Life would be easier with equipment that folded away nicely, you often think. </p></div>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    \n  <div>\n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      <div>\n        <div>\n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img alt=\"\" src=\"/blog/images/7ea862c853-unsplash-image-Ofs3LjEUcrk.webp\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1647\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption>\n          <div></div>\n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  </div>\n\n  \n\n</div></div><div><div><div>\n  \n  <div><p>I have great news for stressed out parents who travel and need space saving alternatives. I am going to show you backdrops, lighting and stands that easily fold up and can even fit in your suitcase. Leaving you no excuses to turn down auditions when out of town. And you definitely will not be sacrificing video quality. </p><p>Pop-up portable backdrops are a smart alternative to huge hanging backdrops. The best part is they do not wrinkle. They also are large enough to cover even the big kids. All of the pop-ups listed here are 5 feet by 6.5 feet. Not bad. </p></div>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    \n  <figure>\n    <div>\n      <div>\n        \n        \n          <div>\n          <div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            <img alt=\"\" src=\"/blog/images/986c640a71-03DEE342-B647-4328-95D7-3C8D5F8FC04F.webp\" width=\"1248\" height=\"1063\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n            <div></div>\n          </div>\n        \n          </div>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <figcaption>\n      <div>\n\n        <div>\n          <div><h4>Folds to a tiny pouch</h4></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <div></div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n\n      </div>\n    </figcaption>\n\n    \n\n\n  </figure>\n\n  \n\n</div></div><div><div><div>\n  \n  <div><p>Yes, you are paying a bit of a premium for convenience. But the colors are fantastic as you can see. </p><p>There are solids that pop and textured abstract neutrals that are dynamic and complimentary to all skin tones. </p></div>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div>\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div>\n  <div>\n    \n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            <div>\n              <div>\n                \n                <a href=\"https://amzn.to/3olXJAe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                  <img src=\"/blog/images/11df287e9b-D1B295B9-D94D-41D4-AC9D-33DEB9E72E6A.webp\" width=\"1240\" height=\"1254\" alt=\"Grey/Blue Pop-up Backdrop\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /><img alt=\"Grey/Blue Pop-up Backdrop\" src=\"/blog/images/11df287e9b-D1B295B9-D94D-41D4-AC9D-33DEB9E72E6A.webp\" width=\"1240\" height=\"1254\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n                </a>\n                \n                  <div>Grey/Blue Pop-up Backdrop</div>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            <div>\n              <div>\n                \n                <a href=\"https://amzn.to/3qGObmz\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                  <img src=\"/blog/images/cd28c70e0b-BB6AFDFA-D66A-42B1-B902-CE58C016F7F3.webp\" width=\"969\" height=\"942\" alt=\"Double-sided Cyan/Beige Pop-up\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /><img alt=\"Double-sided Cyan/Beige Pop-up\" src=\"/blog/images/cd28c70e0b-BB6AFDFA-D66A-42B1-B902-CE58C016F7F3.webp\" width=\"969\" height=\"942\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n                </a>\n                \n                  <div>Double-sided Cyan/Beige Pop-up</div>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            <div>\n              <div>\n                \n                <a href=\"https://amzn.to/30hsb6A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                  <img src=\"/blog/images/7e27cc7a58-C67B6A37-6CD2-4E4F-B0E5-F69BAA9E7855.webp\" width=\"996\" height=\"977\" alt=\"Beige &amp;amp; Pink Pop-up Backdrop\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /><img alt=\"Beige &amp;amp; Pink Pop-up Backdrop\" src=\"/blog/images/7e27cc7a58-C67B6A37-6CD2-4E4F-B0E5-F69BAA9E7855.webp\" width=\"996\" height=\"977\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n                </a>\n                \n                  <div>Beige &amp; Pink Pop-up Backdrop</div>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            <div>\n              <div>\n                \n                <a href=\"https://amzn.to/3bXCzD3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                  <img src=\"/blog/images/ba40d0a0bc-7087C43F-6A67-4FED-A3A9-C2AF2F02CD18.webp\" width=\"930\" height=\"941\" alt=\"Olive &amp;amp; Grey Pop-up Backdrop\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /><img alt=\"Olive &amp;amp; Grey Pop-up Backdrop\" src=\"/blog/images/ba40d0a0bc-7087C43F-6A67-4FED-A3A9-C2AF2F02CD18.webp\" width=\"930\" height=\"941\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n                </a>\n                \n                  <div>Olive &amp; Grey Pop-up Backdrop</div>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            <div>\n              <div>\n                \n                <a href=\"https://amzn.to/3n3n5n6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                  <img src=\"/blog/images/ec75d65e5f-FC40BB11-2AE1-435E-9730-1A7F13D80E37.webp\" width=\"1047\" height=\"856\" alt=\"Red &amp;amp; Blue Pop-up Backdrop \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /><img alt=\"Red &amp;amp; Blue Pop-up Backdrop \" src=\"/blog/images/ec75d65e5f-FC40BB11-2AE1-435E-9730-1A7F13D80E37.webp\" width=\"1047\" height=\"856\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n                </a>\n                \n                  <div>Red &amp; Blue Pop-up Backdrop </div>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            <div>\n              <div>\n                \n                <a href=\"https://amzn.to/3qpYcEe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                  <img src=\"/blog/images/51ab67821f-C6744684-5564-4012-A70F-8F863A7E39A6.webp\" width=\"1027\" height=\"1042\" alt=\"Solid Pink &amp;amp; Grey Pop-up Backdrop \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /><img alt=\"Solid Pink &amp;amp; Grey Pop-up Backdrop \" src=\"/blog/images/51ab67821f-C6744684-5564-4012-A70F-8F863A7E39A6.webp\" width=\"1027\" height=\"1042\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n                </a>\n                \n                  <div>Solid Pink &amp; Grey Pop-up Backdrop </div>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            <div>\n              <div>\n                \n                <a href=\"https://amzn.to/31KUVFj\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                  <img src=\"/blog/images/64848c9c07-02D5A8F1-9E7E-48FC-A2EA-EFB3DDFB84BA.webp\" width=\"877\" height=\"888\" alt=\"Dark Grey &amp;amp; Blue Pop-up Backdrop \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /><img alt=\"Dark Grey &amp;amp; Blue Pop-up Backdrop \" src=\"/blog/images/64848c9c07-02D5A8F1-9E7E-48FC-A2EA-EFB3DDFB84BA.webp\" width=\"877\" height=\"888\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n                </a>\n                \n                  <div>Dark Grey &amp; Blue Pop-up Backdrop </div>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            <div>\n              <div>\n                \n                <a href=\"https://amzn.to/3bXtdXU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                  <img src=\"/blog/images/266e834675-19AAD253-7168-4612-8C9E-322C7E4D63A1.webp\" width=\"871\" height=\"890\" alt=\"Vintage Beige &amp;amp; Green Pop-up Backdrop \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /><img alt=\"Vintage Beige &amp;amp; Green Pop-up Backdrop \" src=\"/blog/images/266e834675-19AAD253-7168-4612-8C9E-322C7E4D63A1.webp\" width=\"871\" height=\"890\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n                </a>\n                \n                  <div>Vintage Beige &amp; Green Pop-up Backdrop </div>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n    \n  </div>\n\n  \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div><div><div><div>\n  \n  <div><p>Also check out <a href=\"/101-blog/time-to-re-think-your-self-tape-backdrop-and-get-one-these-for-under-20\">“Time to re-think your self tape backdrop…”</a> for regular backdrop reccommendations</p></div>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div>\n<div>\n  <hr />\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div><div>\n  \n  <div><p>I bet you are thinking about the struggle of keeping these backdrops upright and sturdy. No worries. A folding light or backdrop stand and some handy photographer clips will save the day and luggage space. </p><p>Worst case scenario - clip these pop-ups to a chair in a pinch. </p></div>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div>\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div>\n  <div>\n    \n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            <div>\n              <div>\n                \n                <a href=\"https://amzn.to/3HeQ3Zh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                  <img src=\"/blog/images/55a195e3a8-ECC45995-0674-44A9-9CFC-004AD69F662F.webp\" width=\"718\" height=\"871\" alt=\"Portable Backdrop Stand\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /><img alt=\"Portable Backdrop Stand\" src=\"/blog/images/55a195e3a8-ECC45995-0674-44A9-9CFC-004AD69F662F.webp\" width=\"718\" height=\"871\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n                </a>\n                \n                  <div>Portable Backdrop Stand</div>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n          \n            <div>\n              <div>\n                \n                <a href=\"https://amzn.to/3D6tLXk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                  \n                  <img src=\"/blog/images/cb71ef827c-4ECC7AC6-707B-46EF-BFB5-1731723C48DE.webp\" width=\"743\" height=\"736\" alt=\"2-Pack Light Stands\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /><img alt=\"2-Pack Light Stands\" src=\"/blog/images/cb71ef827c-4ECC7AC6-707B-46EF-BFB5-1731723C48DE.webp\" width=\"743\" height=\"736\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n                </a>\n                \n                  <div>2-Pack Light Stands</div>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n          \n\n          \n        \n\n      \n    \n  </div>\n\n  \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div><div><div>\n<div>\n  <hr />\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div><div>\n  \n  <div><p>Lighting is what takes up the most space. It is often delicate and a pain to assemble. Have you seen the folding 10” ring light? A couple of these inexpensive lights will surely be enough. </p></div>\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    \n  <div>\n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure>\n        \n      \n        <a href=\"https://amzn.to/3uZClbE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n          \n      <div>\n        <div>\n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img alt=\"\" src=\"/blog/images/ca0d8d6c84-Screenshot-2024-03-07-at-8-50-53-AM.webp\" width=\"1240\" height=\"1404\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n        </a>\n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption>\n          <div><p><a href=\"https://amzn.to/3c0MQ17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Check out on Amazon </a></p></div>\n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  </div>\n\n  \n\n</div></div><div><div>\n<div>\n